{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"cuimao-e-o037","title":"有人告发毛玠出见黥面反者而言使天不雨者盖此也","accounts":[{"id":"cuimao-a-1d7ddeadbc05d1c104c7","label":"正文","text":"有人指毛玠称黥面反叛者妻子没为奴婢、因而天旱；这是告发之词。","evidence":["cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","cuimao-q2-ccfb21b056e477d88438"]},{"id":"cuimao-a-a97abbc66cd44024a87d","label":"正文","text":"曹操大怒，收毛玠付狱","evidence":["cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0301","role":"被告发言使天不雨者；被收付狱者","evidence":["cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"大怒收玠付狱者","evidence":["cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6"]},"ordering_evidence":"cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","source_order":[12,135,10],"order":2762}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0301","name":"毛玠","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q-a49cb30080e12b997156","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-da535e875fd74c51f531","layer":"original","quote":"后有白玠者：“出见黥面反者〖1〗，其妻子没为官奴婢，玠言曰：‘使天不雨者，盖此也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-f703cf1be8fb21d78fe6","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-da535e875fd74c51f531","layer":"original","quote":"太祖大怒，收玠付狱","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-ccfb21b056e477d88438","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-cc7f8da1c3b5a79d1c6c","layer":"original","quote":"玠曰：“臣闻萧生缢死〖23〗，困于石显〖24〗；贾子放外〖25〗，谗在绛、灌〖26〗；白起赐剑于杜邮〖27〗；晁错致诛于东市〖28〗；伍员绝命于吴都〖29〗：斯数子者，或妒其前，或害其后。臣垂髫执简〖30〗，累勤取官〖31〗；职在机近，人事所窜〖32〗。属臣以私，无势不绝〖33〗；语臣以冤，无细不理。人情淫利〖34〗，为法所禁；法禁于利，势能害之。青蝇横生〖35〗，为臣作谤；谤臣之人，势不在他。昔王叔陈生争（正）〔政〕王廷〖36〗，宣子平理〖37〗，命举其契〖38〗；是非有宜，曲直有所：《春秋》嘉焉，是以书之。臣不言此〖39〗，无有时、人。说臣此言，必有征要〖40〗。乞蒙宣子之辨〖41〗，而求王叔之对。若臣以曲闻〖42〗，即刑之日，方之安驷之赠〖43〗；赐剑之来〖44〗，比之重赏之惠。谨以状对。”","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":136,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":353,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
